      <activity id="2e222208-9d3e-5732-95c1-8fc384e15cba" activityNameId="84304a4d-9104-59d3-afcf-f0e405b2ce0a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Disposal, ventilation equipment, Storkair G 90</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Disposal, ventilation equipment, Storkair G 90
Disposal of the ventilation unit for decentral ventilation systems with 120 m3/h average air flow. Housing made of galvanised steel insulated with expanded polystyrene. Heat recovery element made of polystyrene. Total weight of component 32.7 kg;
UUID: 3a0dff18-1382-44b5-b90a-366afaa9ff8e
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces and copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3a0dff18-1382-44b5-b90a-366afaa9ff8e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
